    "note": "OpenMU VersionSeasonSix (KanturuRelics.cs:244): level 117, 87500 life, 830-1085, 865, 1080/440, attack range 4 for its Hair Attack (skill 16). A step past the Ruins' Genocider for geared level-400 heroes, as the Ruins were balanced (da0e7426): life 172,000 (1.25x), damage 1,900-2,000, defence 740 (above ~1,000 melee and bows sit at the damage floor); level 160 and the rates (3357/1350) MU-scaled, ranges and speeds as MU. Measured with the best pre-Kanturu kits at its nest 123,88: 192 / 99 / 87 kills an hour (knight / wizard / elf, best skill and talents), 0 deaths; the Genocider's nest gives 534 / 339 / 159, the gap mostly the Relics' 24 lone nests. Provisional, ours (2026-10-25)."
  },
  "why_this_one": "The Relics' first breed: 24 OpenMU spots across the hall (x 99-199, y 74-160), mixed with the Personas and Dreadfears along the walk (docs/worlds/kanturu-port.md 4.2, 4.4).",
